1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,160
Cross your legs.

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:03,300
Tap just under your kneecap.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,780
Did it KICK?

4
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:05,840
That wasn't you.

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,533
That was your SPINE.

6
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,480
Tap again.

7
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,484
That stretches your thigh

8
00:00:09,484 --> 00:00:10,110
muscle...

9
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:11,737
it pings your spine,

10
00:00:11,737 --> 00:00:14,133
and your spine yanks it back.

11
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,130
Your brain?

12
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,733
Wasn't even asked.

13
00:00:16,758 --> 00:00:17,991
In nineteen-oh-two,

14
00:00:17,991 --> 00:00:19,434
a scientist rang a bell

15
00:00:19,434 --> 00:00:20,840
before each tap.

16
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,660
Then the bell ALONE

17
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,200
made legs kick.

18
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,840
He told the experts...

19
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,000
crickets.

20
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:28,006
Pavlov's dog

21
00:00:28,006 --> 00:00:29,733
got famous instead.

22
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:30,690
No kick?

23
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,890
Clench your teeth...

24
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:33,320
and tap again.

